  (text "Car-side pilot.  CP -> diode -> 2.74k to GND (state B, always) ; 1.3k via K1 to GND (state C).\nK1 = CPC1117N, form-B (CLOSED when unpowered): a dead board presents state C, so the EVSE delivers\nAC and Pin-B wakes the truck.  CP_S2_OPEN high = LED on = K1 open = state B (pause / stop).\nCP read: 200k / 45.3k to 3V3 / 57.6k to GND maps CP -12..+12 V to 0.3..3.0 V (CP 0 V = 1.65 V),\nload on CP >= 200k.  TLV3201 vs 1.65 V, 1M hysteresis (~0.7 V at CP) -> CP_DUTY (MCPWM capture).\nSame node -> ADS1115 AIN0 for the high level (+12 / +9 / +6 V = state A / B / C).\nPP: this board owns PP (Zombie interface=CPC, plug state in 0x357).  4.7k pull-up to 3V3:\nopen 3.3 V, plug 150R ~0.10 V, latch pressed (150R+330R) ~0.31 V -> ADS1115 AIN1."
    (at 20 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "7eede2bf-e03c-5ef8-9ced-a6bde098154c")))
